ay one is the notification day, not the arrival day\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text explicitly distinguishes notification day from arrival day as day one.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Items not collected within 7 days go back into circulation or move to the next borrower in the queue if there is one\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text covers both options for uncollected items past the 7-day period.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"they can request a 7-day extension before the deadline expires\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference supports that borrowers can request extensions before the deadline.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"This extension is granted once per reservation\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Request and reservation refer to the same holding arrangement; the reference states this limit explicitly.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"If an item remains uncollected after being held twice, it goes back to the shelves\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text directly addresses items held twice without collection.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"A-007\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the reservation is cancelled\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference cancels the reservation after an item is uncollected twice; reservation is the holding request.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-001\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Borrowers can reserve items that are on loan or held at another branch\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference directly supports that these item types can be reserved.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-002\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"When the item is ready for collection, the borrower is notified by email\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference explicitly states borrowers are emailed when items are ready.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Shelve items alphabetically by the borrower's surname\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference states items are shelved by surname, placing them under the patron's name.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A reserved item waits on the hold shelf for 7 days from when the borrower is notified\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference specifies the 7-day period runs from notification (when emailed).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"they can request a 7-day extension before the deadline expires\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference allows extension requests before the initial period expires.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"This extension is granted once per reservation\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference explicitly limits extensions to one per reservation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-007\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"go back into circulation or move to the next borrower in the queue if there is one\",